00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:02.401
TRANSPORTS AND WAS ON NORMANDY

00:02:02.402 --> 00:02:04.103
ON JUNE 6, 1944.

00:02:04.104 --> 00:02:05.271
YEARS LATER I WAS HAVING LUNCH

00:02:05.272 --> 00:02:06.439
WITH LYNN AND I JUST HAPPENED

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.041
TO LOOK DOWN AND HIS HAND AND

00:02:09.042 --> 00:02:10.676
NOTICED THAT HIS TWO FINGERS ON

00:02:10.677 --> 00:02:12.078
HIS LEFT HAND WERE GONE.

00:02:12.079 --> 00:02:13.713
AND I ALWAYS THOUGHT HE LOST

00:02:13.714 --> 00:02:15.348
THEM IN A POWER TOOL ACCIDENT.

00:02:15.349 --> 00:02:17.483
I ASKED HIM I SAID LYNN, WHAT

00:02:17.484 --> 00:02:19.785
HAPPENED TO YOUR LEFT HAND.

00:02:19.786 --> 00:02:22.655
HE SAID NAZI SHRAPNEL.

00:02:22.656 --> 00:02:24.257
HE HAD CLIMBED THE CLIFFS AND

00:02:24.258 --> 00:02:26.459
PUT HIS HAND UP AND HALF HIS

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:28.261
HAND WAS BLOWN AWAY.

00:02:28.262 --> 00:02:29.795
HE NEVER BRAGGED OR TALKED

00:02:29.796 --> 00:02:31.197
ABOUT IT.

00:02:31.198 --> 00:02:32.265
MOST OF THE GREATEST GENERATION

00:02:32.266 --> 00:02:33.533
THEY CAME BACK AND WENT BACK TO

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:34.000
WORK.

00:02:34.001 --> 00:02:36.102
A LOT OF THEM DIDN'T LIKE TO

00:02:36.103 --> 00:02:37.970
TALK ABOUT IT UNTIL RECENTLY.

00:02:37.971 --> 00:02:41.874
BUT HE TOLD ME THAT THE SEAS

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:44.443
WERE SO -- WERE SO WAVY AND SO

00:02:44.444 --> 00:02:46.078
UNCONTROLLABLE THAT BY THE TIME

00:02:46.079 --> 00:02:49.182
THEY GOT TO THE NORMANDY BEACH

00:02:49.183 --> 00:02:50.816
THEY WERE ANKLE DEEP IN PUKE

00:02:50.817 --> 00:02:53.119
FROM ALL THE OTHER TROOPS ON

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:53.486
BOARD.

